lua","source":"Spinal Cage","source_tag":"entity name","target":"脊笼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1c189ae1c215427310389e54df1d0b56e05f2fde69bd869322aa2254e5c76320","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"705b2da5ab3a2608cfd64b11bc3b9d2512b4cfcd87ccd6314b2dab60c2456cc0","logical_entry_identity":"058b05b88cfcfc64d6130bb687580fa755664edce5a0529feddc9ea2a5fae158","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"portal to Kroshkkur","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通向克诺什库尔的传送门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"36bde02bde4ab6aeeacfdafc9a4647e3425a0f654b538dac3ce16580e8adff4a","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"705bc3778644ef9af349d75c3f4a507ac3b199dcde1b8305e192aca22cb9a3f8","logical_entry_identity":"3a8729a06e9b7985070bf295ddf6924019de5db4f869792f84992855edaa3da9","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Thought is treasure. Treasure thoughts. Spin fates, tell tales, words of gods, smith into fables. All that is can be rewritten and all writing is defined by what is. Cascades upon cascades which blend into reality, ever altering, ever changing, ever being, ever ceasing.\n\nWords are power. My power is words. I am infinity and its end. Everything is possible.","source_tag":"_t","target":"思想是一种财富。珍惜思想的财富。编织命运，讲述故事，神的语言，编织成传说。一切现实都可以被重写，一切的文字都关联着现实。层叠的层叠融入现实，不断变化，不断改变，永在存续，永在消逝。\n\n言语就是力量。我的力量就是言语。我是无限，我是终结。一切皆有可能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1262fe7c9e377fc93ad1c8e8e806fea491c1aebddc25daf7a4314b9f0e942f62","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"706eddab1398395266da7c216d86e48274e894c2e10a8b37f40a029aac48ff62","logical_entry_identity":"403412a1720a529ba272f9af53bb64cf02404f1279a04a768c4147af564cf6cf","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"You trigger an explosion of your chaos orbs on a target.\n\t\tThe orbs do no damage but confuse it for %d turns with a confusion power of 10%% per orb.\n\t\tYour effective spellpower used to overcome the target's mental save is also increased by 10%% per orb.\n\t\tAll your orbs are always spent.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你在目标位置引爆混沌之球。\n\t\t这场爆炸不造成伤害，但是会使目标混乱 %d 回合，同时每引爆一个球，混乱强度增加 10%%。\n\t\t在对抗目标的精神豁免时，每个混沌之球还会增加你的有效法术强度10%%。\n\t\t这个技能会消耗所有的混沌之球。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4badb1dfd856101ecf3c7c6b88abdbbf646655b88cd362bfbb999eb0f02b47b6","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"7072fbc6659ab9e9ed77870815f9bc45cf7d855469976ef8a434a9f60ea7caa9","logical_entry_identity":"c9cd0e4ba3af32d6b0fa59dc53c24e5ecf0372362fff32263c6e6b170efbea3d","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"The many tentacled ones are piling on the ground, forming mass graves.","source_tag":"_t","target":"许多触手怪的尸体堆积在地上，形成了万人坑。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"25ea18a454dd093114838c93ef419b1d2473d97c6f9700daf9f89836ca40b70f","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"707902886eb708cf718ea0325244d3edc3e93bb45c27e9440e1b568d341f18af","logical_entry_identity":"b677e81275532049f6b8ab6d277edf77c72b9e63317fcf806999ea5fe7620d81","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Player","source_tag":"_t","target":"玩家"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0b4cc1ecab37d29b3bc49900aa06aed5b04a174dd4e4711122cd1f63b97b3142","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"708e943589c5b6152140492def3a047427ea62b4ea89c20128947d7a8c09e2e7","logical_entry_identity":"bbddedff9ae292a7f4ebe940d7276bb6dc85bd74991ab2554665ccba78084989","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Lessons of Inevitability - Netherblast","source_tag":"_t","target":"有关必然性的课程——彼世冲击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c456b63fd664f83c7bf94ffb1ca224daf0475091d3f3bde951ce22cc3bc719b5","component":"cults","entry_revision_identity":"7096ca7cdffa171baec965e7484975084915127ab87d1cd845581ccd4de93dd3","logical_entry_identity":"e18429354dd25a396a69dd9fc5e1cf4e55fe77618f2a4ad36525455261e50104","normalized_path":"tome-cults.lua","source":"Sanity Warp","source_tag":"talent name","target":"失智冲击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"feb1eb11f6b0e9f22e6b4068ada7ae1aebc220d40b00bfb0dc00bbf5ee25dc74","component":